## 3. Optimized Solution (Sliding Window + GCD)

```python
from typing import List
from math import gcd

class Solution:
    def maxLength(self, nums: List[int]) -> int:
        n = len(nums)
        i = 0
        p = 1
        ans = 2

        for j in range(n):
            while gcd(p, nums[j]) != 1:
                p //= nums[i]
                i += 1

            p *= nums[j]

            ans = max(ans, j - i + 1)

        return ans
```

### Complexity Analysis
- Time Complexity: O(n log M)
- Space Complexity: O(1)

