## Complexity Comparison

| Approach | Time Complexity | Space Complexity |
|----------|-----------------|------------------|
| Brute Force | O(n³ log M) | O(1) |
| Better | O(n² log M) | O(1) |
| Optimized | O(n log M) | O(1) |

Where:
- n = Length of the array.
- M = Maximum element in the array.

Complexities assume fixed-size arithmetic and exclude
Python's arbitrary-precision integer overhead.
